        <object label="&lt;b&gt;THREE LAYERS — defense.js, in call order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;L1 input defend() → scanInput&lt;br&gt; block if conf &amp;gt;= 0.5, warn &amp;gt;= 0.3&lt;br&gt; blocked ⇒ target never called&lt;br&gt;L2 prompt buildSandwichedPrompt()&lt;br&gt; USER INPUT START/END markers&lt;br&gt; reminder block + canary&lt;br&gt;L3 output validateOutput()&lt;br&gt; canary · prompt leak n-gram&lt;br&gt; PII 5 kinds · markers&lt;br&gt; topic drift → safe" class="card.invariant" id="card_layers">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
