        <object label="&lt;b&gt;GRADED ON HELD-OUT ONLY — scorer.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;training 59 — the regexes were tuned on them&lt;br&gt;held-out 29 — never shown&lt;br&gt;both run the SAME defend()&lt;br&gt;split kept apart in buildSummary&lt;br&gt;grade = f(held-out, FP, latency)&lt;br&gt; detect 0-50 · FP 0-30&lt;br&gt; latency 0-20 → A/B/C/D/F&lt;br&gt;verdict gates runner.js&lt;br&gt; held-out &amp;gt;=70% · FP &amp;lt;5% · avg &amp;lt;100ms&lt;br&gt;observed run: 100.0% / 86.2% · 0 FP · 0.25ms" class="card.failure" id="card_grade">
